echoes of the past shape the battles of the present. Unfold a new story in the universe of A Plague Tale, through the entwined destinies of two heroes linked by fate and the Macula\u2019s mysterious legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713000/extras/79bccaf84648cca0282a9cefe94b849a.avif?t=1764164868\" width=616 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713000/extras/a80e4d2e232a7ee48cafa4784ca30d92.avif?t=1764164868\" width=616 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Guided by the knowledge safeguarded in your notebook, follow in your crew\u2019s footsteps to explore a richly detailed world, unravel its secrets, and face deadly trials. Use a stolen Minoan sphere to solve ingenious puzzles by manipulating light - a force woven by Daedalus into the island\u2019s very heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713000/extras/d3fa10b08b262acb25525e097a8e411b.avif?t=1764164868\" width=616 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713000/extras/c3539a11e8d24ebee186d17a7d31169b.avif?t=1764164868\" width=616 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It is said that only a few came back from the island. Lurking in the shadows lives a restless presence. It follows you around, seemingly knowing your every move, as it hunts through the island\u2019s depths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every step is a risk. Every pause, a potential end. You can\u2019t stop, only hide, outsmart, and push forward. Can you survive each trial and every step or will you join those who never came back?</p>","developers":["Asobo Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713000/1e291a113dfe7805ad2935a67738d33bd13ccaf5/header.jpg?t=1764164868","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Resonance: A Plague Tale Legacy, a game developed by Asobo Studio and published by Focus Entertainment. Resonance: A Plague Tale Legacy, Focus Entertainment and its logo are trademarks, registered trademarks or pending trademark applications of Focus Entertainment. The game and technology are the property of Asobo Studio. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2713000/603120807/831232f7e6c2885039d87f25ed8ea7ffb8226e1b/1750893364/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749416645","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2713000/603120807/831232f7e6c2885039d87f25ed8ea7ffb8226e1b/1750893364/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749416645","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2713000/603120807/831232f7e6c2885039d87f25ed8ea7ffb8226e1b/1750893364/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749416645","id":257151683,"name":"Resonance: A Plague Tale Legacy - Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151683/9c7f53ec605a5b5a012ef7a559899c094cf18259/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749416645"}],"name":"Resonance: A Plague Tale Legacy","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":